/.github/CODEOWNERS                      @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads

/terraform/environments/dev/foundation/delivery/app-ci-roles.tf     @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads
/terraform/environments/dev/foundation/delivery/terraform.tfvars    @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads

# GitOps PR 검사 source와 등록 경로는 운영 책임자가 승인합니다.
/ci/                                      @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads
/tests/delivery/                          @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads
/requirements-delivery.txt                @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads
/gitops/clusters/                         @amazon-commerce-lab/sre-leads
